---
import LegalLayout from '../layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
const updated = 'May 10, 2026';
---

<LegalLayout title="Cookie Policy">
  <p>Last updated: {updated}</p>
  <h2>1. What cookies are</h2>
  <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device by websites. They can be used to make websites work, remember preferences, or collect usage information.</p>
  <h2>2. How this website uses cookies</h2>
  <p>This website does not use cookie-based analytics. We use GoatCounter to count visits and understand general website usage, configured without cookies or persistent user tracking.</p>
  <p>We may use strictly necessary technical storage only where required for the website to function, protect the website, or process a contact form submission.</p>
  <h2>3. Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>You can control cookies through your browser settings. Because the website does not use advertising cookies or cookie-based analytics, the goal is to avoid showing a cookie banner unless future technical choices make one necessary.</p>
  <h2>4. Changes to this policy</h2>
  <p>We may update this Cookie Policy from time to time. The latest version will be published on this page with an updated date.</p>
</LegalLayout>
